     2596             "По строке товара : " buf_goods.artic " " buf_goods.prod-type " " buf_goods.prod-code " " buf_goods.gds-name skip
     2597             "на объекте: " buf_trn-doc.obj-type " " buf_trn-doc.obj-code
     2598             skip
